# BrandForge — live search-demand data configuration.
#
# NO SETUP REQUIRED: with this file empty (or absent), BrandForge uses the
# free Google Trends + Autocomplete backend — live interest trends, rising
# searches, and real question queries with no key or account.
#
# Configure Semrush below only if you want absolute search volumes and CPC.

# ── Optional upgrade A: Semrush Analytics REST API ───────────────────────
# Classic API key. Requires a Semrush plan with API units (usually the
# separate API add-on). Takes precedence over Google when set.
SEMRUSH_API_KEY=

# ── Optional upgrade B: Semrush MCP server ───────────────────────────────
# Uses Semrush's official MCP endpoint (https://mcp.semrush.com/v2/mcp).
# Requires an MCP-enabled plan (Semrush One Starter/Pro+, SEO Classic
# Pro/Guru) — see https://www.semrush.com/mcp-access
#
# B1. OAuth (default): set SEARCH_MODE=semrush-mcp, start the app, then
#     click "Connect Semrush account" in the Insights step. Tokens persist
#     in data/semrush-oauth.json.
# B2. API key over MCP: additionally set SEMRUSH_MCP_API_KEY and skip OAuth.
#SEARCH_MODE=semrush-mcp
#SEMRUSH_MCP_API_KEY=

# ── Optional: USPTO trademark search (name availability checks) ─────────
# Domain availability always works (official registry RDAP, no key).
# For the USPTO trademark knockout search, create a FREE account at
# https://markerapi.com (1,000 searches/month) and paste credentials here.
# Without them, name checks still show domains + a pre-filled USPTO link.
MARKER_API_USERNAME=
MARKER_API_PASSWORD=

# ── Advanced overrides ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SEARCH_MODE=google|semrush-api|semrush-mcp|off
#                             force a backend (default: semrush-api if key
#                             set, else semrush-mcp if connected, else google)
# SEMRUSH_DATABASE=us         region for all backends (Semrush database /
#                             Google geo)
# SEMRUSH_MCP_URL=            override Semrush MCP endpoint (testing)
# SEMRUSH_API_URL=            override Semrush REST endpoint (testing)
# GOOGLE_TRENDS_URL=          override Google Trends base URL (testing)
# GOOGLE_SUGGEST_URL=         override Google Autocomplete base URL (testing)
# SEMRUSH_MCP_REDIRECT_URL=   public OAuth callback URL when behind a
#                             proxy/domain, e.g. https://yourapp.com/api/semrush/callback
# PORT=3000
